{
  "input": "Vaccinations vyaktiyon aur samudaayon ko sankramak beemariyon se bachane ke liye kaise kaam karte hain, aur herd immunity kya hai?",
  "output_1": "Vaccinations aam taur par ek virus ya bacteria ka ek roop ya ghatak pesh karke, ya hamare sharir ko virus jaisa ghatak banane ka nirdesh dekar kaam karte hain, jo phir immune system ko sankraman se ladne ke liye antibodies banane ke liye trigger karta hai. Vaccine lagwane se aap khud ko aur un logon ko bhi bachate hain jo sankramak beemariyon se gambhir roop se beemar ho sakte hain ya mar sakte hain, aur is tarah samudaay ko bhi bachate hain.\nHerd immunity ek avdharna hai jismein ek aabadi ka ek mahatvapurna hissa kisi vishesh beemari ke prati immune hota hai, ya to vaccination ya prakritik sankraman ke madhyam se, jo un vyaktiyon ke liye suraksha pradan karta hai jo vaccine nahi le sakte ya prakritik roop se immunity prapt nahi kar sakte, jaise ki navjaat shishu, garbhvati mahilayen, aur kamjor immune system wale vyakti. Herd immunity tab prapt hoti hai jab ek samudaay mein logon ki ek mahatvapurna seema kisi beemari ke prati immune ho jaati hai.",
  "output_2": "Vaccinations kisi vyakti ke sharir mein virus ya bacteria ka kamjor ya nishkriya roop, ya uski sanrachna ke hisse jaise proteins ko daalkar kaam karte hain. Immune system in videshi padarthon, jinhe antigens kaha jaata hai, ko hamlavar ke roop mein pehchanta hai aur antibodies naamak vishesh proteins ka utpadan karke pratikriya deta hai. Ye antibodies bhavishya mein yadi vyakti vastavik roganu ke sampark mein aata hai to virus ya bacteria ko nishprabhavi karne mein saksham hote hain.\nImmune system memory cells bhi banata hai, jo yaad rakhte hain ki yadi vyakti bhavishya mein rog paida karne wale jeev ke sampark mein aata hai to sahi antibodies ko tezi se kaise banaya jaaye. Yah pratikriya vyakti ko beemar hone se rok sakti hai ya beemari ki gambhirta ko kaafi had tak kam kar sakti hai.\nVaccinations na keval vyaktiyon ko balki herd immunity naamak avdharna ke madhyam se samudaayon ko bhi suraksha pradan karte hain."
}

{
  "input": "Ek kalpanik website ke website design ka mulyankan karein.",
  "output_1": "Website ka overall layout accessible hai aur navigate karne mein aasan hai. Layout sahaj hai, jiska matlab hai ki users jis jaankari ko dhoondh rahe hain, us tak jaldi aur kushalta se pahunch sakte hain. Iske alawa, structure users ko kam se kam koshish mein wah cheez dhoondhne deta hai jo ve dhoondh rahe hain. Website design bhi aakarshak hai, jisme vibrant rangon aur graphics ke saath ek modern aur sleek look hai.\n \nJin kshetron mein website sudhar kar sakti hai, ve hain iski usability. Search bar thoda chhipa hua hai aur kuch users ke liye aasani se accessible nahi ho sakta hai. Iske alawa, kuch pages dheere-dheere load hote hain, jisse website ko navigate karna aur mushkil ho sakta hai.\n\nSankshep mein, website overall accessible hai, sundar roop se design ki gayi hai, aur intuitive navigation ke saath acchi tarah se sanrachit hai. Kuch usability sudharon ke saath, website aur bhi behtar ho jayegi.",
  "output_2": "Website design dekhne mein sundar hai, jiska layout simple aur modern hai. Chamkeele aur vibrant rangon ka upyog website ko dekhne mein aakarshak banane mein madad karta hai. Font ke vikalp professional aur aakarshak hain, aur images saaf aur dhyaan kheenchne waali hain. Iske alawa, navigation bar sahaj aur istemal karne mein aasan hai, jisse zaroori jaankari dhoondhna aasan ho jaata hai."
}

