{
  "input": "Neeche diye gaye do sentences mein se har ek mein \"they\" kisko refer karta hai: \na) \"The authorities have denied authorization to the demonstrators because they feared violence.\"\nb) \"The authorities have denied authorization to the demonstrators because they appeared belligerent.\"",
  "output_1": "Syntactically dekha jaye to, dono sentences mein \"they\" antecedent ke roop mein ya to authorities ya demonstrators ko refer kar sakta hai. Lekin, sentence ke semantics ke aadhar par, har mamle mein ek zyada sambhavit antecedent hai. Sentence (a) mein, \"they\" shayad authorities ko refer karta hai, kyunki is baat ka koi matlab nahi banta ki demonstrators hinsa se daren aur is vajah se authorities authorization na dein. Doosri taraf, sentence (b) mein, \"they\" shayad demonstrators ko refer karta hai, kyunki saaf taur par aakramak (belligerent) demonstrators authorization na dene ka ek aam kaaran hain, aur saaf taur par aakramak (belligerent) authorities nahi.",
  "output_2": "Syntactically dekha jaye to, dono sentences mein \"they\" antecedent ke roop mein ya to authorities ya demonstrators ko refer kar sakta hai. Lekin, hum demonstrators aur authorities ke nature ke aadhar par anuman laga sakte hain.\na) \"They\" demonstrators ko refer karta hai. Demonstrators hinsa se darte the isliye unhone apne jeene, azaadi, aur sampatti ke adhikar ki raksha ke liye pradarshan kiya.\nb) \"They\" authorities ko refer karta hai. Authorities ne nishchit roop se pradarshankariyon par karvai ki, jo authorities ki aakramakta (belligerence) ko dikhata hai."
}

{
  "input": "NBA MVP (Most Valuable Player) award ceremony ek bahut hi intezaar kiya jaane wala event hai jo regular NBA season ke ant ke paas hota hai, aam taur par playoffs ke dauraan. Kripya is drishya ka varnan karein. Adhik jaankari: Yeh ceremony National Basketball Association (NBA) dwara us khiladi ko sammanit karne ke liye aayojit ki jaati hai jise uske vyaktigat pradarshan, netritva, aur khel par prabhav ke aadhar par regular season ke dauraan apni team ke liye sabse moolyavaan maana gaya hai.",
  "output_1": "1981 ka NBA MVP award ceremony 12 May ko New York City mein aayojit kiya gaya tha. Yeh award Los Angeles Lakers ke Kareem Abdul-Jabbar ko NBA Commissioner David Stern dwara pradan kiya gaya tha. Apne acceptance speech ke dauraan, Abdul-Jabbar ne teamwork ke mahatva par zor diya aur kaha ki vah \"kisi bahut badi cheez ka bas ek chhota sa hissa\" the. Is ceremony mein Abdul-Jabbar ke teammates, jinmein Magic Johnson, aur Boston Celtics ke Larry Bird shamil the, bhi maujood the.",
  "output_2": "NBA MVP award ceremony dekhne layak ek shaandaar nazaara tha! Roshanian tezi se chamak rahi theen, bheed utsukta se gunj rahi thi, aur mahaul mein bijli si daud rahi thi. MVP ki ghoshna ke liye stage taiyar tha, aur jab woh pal aaya, toh woh sachmuch avismaraneey tha. Vijeta ko stage par bulaya gaya, jahan unhein zoron ki taaliyon ke beech pratishthit puraskar mila. Yeh ek aisa pal tha jo NBA ke itihaas ke panno mein hamesha ke liye darj ho jayega.\n\nJaise hi vijeta ek chamakdar muskaan ke saath MVP trophy pakde stage par khada hua, bheed ka utsaah charam par pahunch gaya. Taaliyan jaise kabhi na khatm hone wali lag rahi theen, jo poore bade hall mein goonj rahi theen. Camere chamak rahe the, khiladi ke chehre par bhavna aur khushi ko kaid kar rahe the jab ve apne saathiyon, prashansakon aur basketball ke diggajon se mili is zabardast swikriti mein doobe hue the."
}

