  "output_2": "Syntactically dekha jaaye toh, dono sentences mein \"they\" authorities ya demonstrators, dono mein se kisi ko bhi as an antecedent refer kar sakta hai. Lekin, hum demonstrators aur authorities ke nature ke basis par infer kar sakte hain.\na) \"They\" demonstrators ko refer karta hai. Demonstrators ko violence ka darr tha isliye unhone apni life, liberty, aur property ke right ko protect karne ke liye demonstrate kiya.\nb) \"They\" authorities ko refer karta hai. Authorities ne definitely protesters par crackdown kiya, jisse authorities ka belligerence dikhta hai."
