{
  "input": "Vaccinations individuals aur communities ko infectious diseases se protect karne ke liye kaise kaam karti hain, aur herd immunity kya hai?",
  "output_1": "Vaccinations aam taur par ek virus ya bacteria ka form ya component introduce karke kaam karti hain, ya hamari bodies ko ek virus-jaisa component produce karne ke liye instruct karke, jo phir immune system ko trigger karta hai infection se ladne ke liye antibodies produce karne ke liye. Vaccinated hone se aap khud ko aur un logon ko protect karte hain jo infectious diseases se serious illness ya death ke liye zyada vulnerable ho sakte hain, aur is tarah community ko bhi.\nHerd immunity ek concept hai jismein ek population ka ek significant portion kisi particular disease se immune hota hai, ya toh vaccination se ya natural infection se, jo un individuals ke liye protection provide karta hai jo vaccines nahi le sakte ya naturally immunity acquire nahi kar sakte, jaise ki newborns, pregnant women, aur jinka immune system compromised hai. Herd immunity tab achieve hoti hai jab ek community mein logon ka ek critical threshold us disease se immune ho jaata hai.",
  "output_2": "Vaccinations ek person ki body mein virus ya bacteria ka ek weakened ya inactivated form, ya uske structure ke parts jaise proteins, introduce karke kaam karti hain. Immune system in foreign substances ko, jinhe antigens kehte hain, invaders ke roop mein recognize karta hai aur antibodies naam ke specific proteins produce karke ek response mount karta hai. Yeh antibodies virus ya bacteria ko neutralize karne mein capable hain agar woh person future mein actual pathogen ke contact mein aata hai.\nImmune system memory cells bhi generate karta hai, jo yaad rakhte hain ki agar person future mein disease-causing organism ke contact mein aaye toh sahi antibodies jaldi se kaise produce karni hain. Yeh response us person ko bimaar hone se prevent kar sakta hai ya illness ki severity ko kaafi had tak reduce kar sakta hai.\nVaccinations sirf individuals ko hi nahi balki communities ko bhi protect karti hain, ek concept ke through jise herd immunity kehte hain."
}

