{
  "input": "Samjhaiye: Pathos, Ethos, Logos",
  "output_1": "Ethos naitik appeal hai, jiska istemaal lekhak ki vishvasniyata ya charitra ke baare mein darshakon ko manane ke liye kiya jaata hai. Pathos bhavnaatmak appeal hai, jiska istemaal darshakon ko unki bhavnaon ko appeal karke manane ke liye kiya jaata hai. Logos tark ke liye appeal hai aur iska istemaal tark aur kaaran ka upyog karke darshakon ko manane ke liye kiya jaata hai.",
  "output_2": "Pathos samjhane ka ek tool hai jiska istemaal pathakon ki bhavnaon ko sakaratmak ya nakaratmak bhavnaon ko jagakar appeal karne ke liye kiya jaata hai. Iska istemaal rhetoric, sahitya, film aur abhiyakti ke anya rupon mein kiya ja sakta hai. Jabki pathos ka istemaal bhavnaatmak pratikriya paane ke liye kiya jaata hai, anya rhetorical appeals kramashah vishvasniyata aur tark ko appeal karti hain. Ethos kisi vyakti, samuh ya sansthan ka vishisht charitra, bhavna, naitik prakriti ya margdarshak vishwas hai. Yeh aksar tathyon, sankhyaon ya aankdon ke roop mein spasht hota hai aur iska istemaal darshakon ko kisi tark ke liye manane ke liye kiya jaata hai."
}

