  "input": "Neeche di gayi sthiti par apni sabse achhi salah dein.\n\nMujhe engineer nahi banna hai, mujhe physics pasand hai. Hi, main abhi high school mein hoon aur parivar mein kuch financial problems hain, mere mata-pita mere physics karne se khush nahi hain (matlab degree lena aur aage ki padhai karna) kyunki main engineering karne ka bhi soch raha hoon kyonki yeh ek zaroorat ban gayi hai. Lekin main physics nahi chhodna chahta, mujhe atomic physics aur cosmology bahut pasand hai. Main yahan puchna chahta hoon, kya main engineering (IT) karte hue physics ke liye apne passion ko jaari rakh sakta hoon, kya mere passion ke liye samay milega? Ya phir kya apne passion ko follow karne aur apne parivar ko isse bahar nikalne ka koi scope hai?",
