  "output_2": "Collatz Conjecture ganit mein ek prasiddh ansuljhi samasya hai, jise 3n + 1 conjecture ya Ulam conjecture ke naam se bhi jaana jaata hai. Yeh kehta hai ki kisi bhi positive integer n ke liye, yadi n even hai, to use 2 se divide karein, anyatha, yadi n odd hai, to use 3 se multiply karein aur 1 jod dein. Phir parinaam lein aur prapt naye maan ke saath is prakriya ko dohraayein, aur isi tarah aage badhein. Conjecture ka daava hai ki aap chahe kisi bhi positive integer se shuru karein, yeh prakriya hamesha ant mein 1 tak pahunch jaayegi.\n\nUdaaharan ke liye, yadi hum sankhya 6 se shuru karte hain, jo even hai, to hum use 2 se divide karke 3 prapt karte hain. Kyunki 3 odd hai, hum use 3 se multiply karte hain aur 1 jodkar 10 prapt karte hain. Isi tarah jaari rakhte hue, humein sequence 6, 3, 10, 5, 16, 8, 4, 2, 1 milta hai. Conjecture yeh daava karta hai ki yeh sequence hamesha 1 par samapt hota hai, chahe aap kisi bhi sankhya se shuru karein.\n\nCollatz Conjecture ki saralta ke baavajood, yeh ansuljha hua hai, aur koi bhi ise sabhi positive integers ke liye saabit ya galat saabit nahi kar paaya hai. Halaanki ise computer dwara bahut badi sankhya mein maamlon ke liye verify kiya gaya hai, yeh ganit ki sabse dilchasp khuli samasyaon mein se ek bani hui hai."
}

