{
  "input": "Sigmoid kya hai?",
  "output_1": "Sigmoid ek prakar ka curve hai jo aam taur par machine learning aur statistics mein istemal hota hai. Yeh ek smooth, continuous curve hai. Is curve ka aam taur par kai uddeshyon ke liye istemal kiya jaata hai jaise ki image ya audio processing, natural language processing, aur speech recognition.",
  "output_2": "Sigmoid activation function aam taur par binary classification neural network ke output layer mein istemal kiya jaata hai, jahan lakshya input ke do classes mein se ek se sambandhit hone ki sambhavna ka anuman lagana hota hai. Aisa isliye hai kyunki sigmoid function apne input ko 0 aur 1 ke beech ke value mein map karta hai, jise ek sambhavna ke roop mein interpret kiya ja sakta hai.\n\nHyperbolic tangent (tanh) activation function sigmoid function ke jaisa hi hai, lekin yeh apne input ko -1 aur 1 ke beech ke value mein map karta hai. Ise aksar neural network ke hidden layers mein istemal kiya jaata hai, kyunki yeh model mein non-linearity laane mein madad karta hai. Ise output layer mein bhi istemal kiya jaata hai jab task ek multiclass classification samasya ho.\n\nSankshep mein, sigmoid ka istemal binary classification ke liye kiya jaata hai aur tanh ka istemal multiclass classification ya neural network ke hidden layers mein non-linearity laane ke liye kiya jaata hai."
}

