  "input": "Yuddhon mein rashtron, rajyon, samuhon, ya vyaktiyon ke beech sashastra sangharsh shamil hote hain, jiske parinaamswaroop jaan ka nuksaan, sampatti ki kshati, aabadi ka visthapan, aur kai anya prakar ki peeda hoti hai. Kya thumb war hinsa hai? Mujhe sharirik aur manovaigyanik dono tarah ki hinsa ki parwah hai.",
  "output_1": "Vastav mein, ise aam taur par ek hinsa gatividhi nahi mana jata hai, balki ek mazedaar aur hanirahit manoranjan mana jata hai. Yeh aam taur par ek halka-phulka aur khel-kood ke andaaz mein hota hai, jaise ki ek dostana pratiyogita ya samay bitane ka ek tareeka.",
  "output_2": "Haan, yuddh svabhav se hi hinsa hai. Yuddhon mein hinsa paramparik ladaiyon se lekar, jinmein agneyastra aur topkhane ka istemal hota hai, yuddh ke anya tareekon tak ho sakti hai, jaise ki bambari, rasayanik aur jaivik yuddh, guerrilla yuddh, aur bhi bahut kuch.\n\nYuddh mein na keval pratyaksh sharirik hinsa hoti hai, balki manovaigyanik hinsa bhi ho sakti hai. Yoddhaon aur nagrikon dono dwara anubhav kiya gaya trauma post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD), depression, chinta, aur anya sthitiyon jaise deerghakalik mansik swasthya samasyaon ka kaaran ban sakta hai.\n\nYuddh ke parinaam aksar tatkalin sangharsh se aage tak failte hain, jisse lambe samay tak samajik, rajnitik, aur arthik badhaein paida hoti hain. Yahi kaaran hai ki yuddhon ko rokne ke liye kootniti, batchit, aur shanti sthapna mission ke madhyam se antarrashtriya star par lagatar prayas kiye jaate hain."
