{
  "input": "Naphthalene ek padarth hai jo mothballs mein paaya jaata hai. Padarthon ko hamesha savdhani se handle karna zaroori hai. Insaano ke liye kitna naphthalene haanikarak hai? Main naphthalene-based moth repellents ke vikalpon par vichaar kar raha hoon, jaise cedarwood balls ya lavender se bhare sachets.\n",
  "output_1": "NIOSH dwara anushansit time-weighted average (TWA) exposure limit naphthalene ke liye 10 ppm ya lagbhag 50mg/m³ hai, 40-ghante ke kaaryasaptah ke dauraan 10-ghante ke kaaryadivas tak ke liye, jiske upar insaano ko gambhir nuksaan ho sakta hai.",
  "output_2": "Bilkul! Naphthalene ek organic compound hai jo aam taur par mothballs se juda hota hai. Ise in products mein istemaal kiya jaata hai kyunki yeh patangon aur doosre keedon ke liye repellent ka kaam karta hai. Haalaanki, naphthalene waale products ko handle aur istemaal karte samay, kai suraksha chintaon ke baare mein jaagruk rehna zaroori hai, jaise toxicity, inhalation, flammability, paryaavaran sambandhi chintaayein, aadi. Agar kisi par naphthalene nigalne ka sandeh ho ya usmein poisoning ke lakshan dikh rahe hon, to turant medical sahayata lena zaroori hai."
}

