  "input": "Psychology insaano aur gair-insaano mein mann aur vyavhaar ka adhyayan hai. Psychologists dimaag ke ubharte guno ki samajh haasil karna chahte hain, is discipline ko neuroscience se jodte hue. Social scientists ke roop mein, psychologists vyaktiyon aur samuhon ke vyavhaar ko samajhna chahte hain. Kya psychology ka koi aisa field hai jo isse deal karta hai ki ek vyakti apne aas-paas ki cheezon aur jagahon par kaise react karta hai, woh kya hai?\nHint: Psychology mein chetan aur achetna ghatnaon ka adhyayan shaamil hai, jismein bhavnaayein aur vichaar bhi shaamil hain. Yeh ek bahut bade scope wala academic discipline hai, jo natural aur social sciences ke beech ki seemaon ko paar karta hai.",
  "output_1": "Haan, yeh Environmental Psychology hai.",
  "output_2": "Haan, psychology ka ek field hai jo isse deal karta hai ki ek vyakti apne aas-paas ki cheezon aur jagahon par kaise react karta hai. Ise \"Psychology\" kehte hain. Yeh jaanchta hai ki log apne physical environment ko kaise dekhte hain aur uske saath kaise interact karte hain, jismein unke ghar, kaam karne ki jagah aur public spaces shaamil hain. Yeh explore karta hai ki lighting, temperature, shor aur layout jaise environmental factors insaani vyavhaar, mood aur kalyaan ko kaise prabhavit kar sakte hain. Yeh urban planning, sustainability, aur health aur well-being ko badhava dene ke liye public spaces ke design jaise vishayon ka bhi adhyayan kar sakta hai."
