{
  "input": "Aapko ek medical condition di gayi hai. Is medical condition ka 3-5 vaakyon mein vivaran likhein: Moyamoya Syndrome",
  "output_1": "Moyamoya syndrome ek durlabh cerebrovascular disorder hai jiski pehchan internal carotid arteries ke progressive stenosis se hoti hai, jiske kaaran dimaag ke base mein chhoti rakt vahikaon ka ek network ban jaata hai. Rukavat ke prati yeh pratikriya angiography par \"dhuein ke gubaar\" jaisi dikhti hai. Dimaag mein rakt ki aapurti kam hone se stroke jaise lakshan ho sakte hain, jaise kamzori, sunnapan, aur drishti ki haani. Isse daure, vikas mein deri, aur vyavaharik badlav bhi ho sakte hain.",
  "output_2": "Moyamoya syndrome ek durlabh medical condition hai jo dimaag mein rakt vahikaon ko prabhavit karti hai. Iski pehchan dimaag mein rakt vahikaon ke dheere-dheere kathor hone aur sankre hone se hoti hai, jisse stroke ya anya gambhir jatiltayein ho sakti hain. Yeh syndrome aam taur par dimaag ke base ke paas rakt vahikaon mein ek asamanyata ke kaaran hota hai. Lakshanon mein sirdard, dhyaan aur smaran shakti mein samasyaayein, aur drishti sambandhi gadbadiyan shamil ho sakti hain. Gambhir maamlon mein, lakshanon mein stroke jaise episode aur daure bhi shamil ho sakte hain. Upchar ke vikalpon mein revascularization prakriyaayein shamil hain, jaise ki brain bypass surgery, taaki dimaag mein rakt pravaah ko behtar banaya ja sake."
}

{
  "input": "Apni productivity badhane ke 5 tarike bataiye.",
  "output_1": "1. Lakshya tay karein aur unhe haasil karne ke liye ek plan banayein.\n2. Notifications band karke, timers set karke, aur ek samay mein ek hi kaam par dhyan dekar dhyan bhatkane wali cheezon ko kam karein.\n3. Niyamit roop se break lein aur apne dimaag ko aaram dein.\n4. Kaamon ko prathmikta dein aur sabse zaroori kaamon par pehle dhyan dein.\n5. Din ka woh sabse achha samay dhoondhein jab aap sabse zyada productive hote hain aur us samay ka istemal apne sabse zaroori kaamon ke liye karein.",
  "output_2": "Zaroor. **Spasht Lakshya Tay Karein:** Apne kaam ko uddeshya aur disha dene ke liye vishisht aur praapt karne yogya lakshya paribhashit karein. **Kaamon ko Prathmikta Dein:** Un kaamon par dhyan dein jinka sabse zyada prabhav ho aur jo aapke lakshyon ke anuroop hon, iske liye Eisenhower Matrix jaisi takneekon ka upyog karein. **Time Blocking:** Ek sanrachit schedule banane ke liye alag-alag kaamon ke liye samay ke vishisht block allocate karein. **Dhyan Bhatkane Wali Cheezon ko Hatayein:** Notifications band karke, gair-zaroori tabs band karke, aur ek samarpit workspace banakar badhaon ko kam karein. **Pomodoro Technique ka Upyog Karein:** Ekagrata banaye rakhne aur burnout se bachne ke liye 25-minute ke focused intervals mein kaam karein, jiske baad ek chhota break lein. **Kaam Saunpein aur Outsource Karein:** Aise kaam saunpein jinhe doosre log kar sakte hain, jisse aapka samay zyada prathmikta wale kaamon ke liye bach sake. **Mindfulness ka Abhyas Karein:** Meditation aur gehri saans lene jaisi takneekein dhyan kendrit karne aur tanav kam karne mein madad kar sakti hain."
}

