{
  "input": "Ek aadarsh website ke look and feel ka varnan karein.",
  "output_1": "Ek aadarsh website ka look saaf, modern, aur dekhne mein aakarshak hona chahiye. Iska layout achhe se व्यवस्थित hona chahiye, jismein ek consistent color scheme ho jo brand ki pehchan se mel khaati ho. Website ka design responsive bhi hona chahiye, jiska matlab hai ki yeh sabhi devices par achha dikhna chahiye aur theek se kaam karna chahiye.\n\nFeel ke maamle mein, website user-friendly aur sahaj honi chahiye. Website ko users ko surakshit mehsoos karana chahiye, khaas kar jab unhein personal jaankari daalni ho ya koi khareedari karni ho.",
  "output_2": "Ek aadarsh website ka content engaging, relevant, aur intended audience ke anusaar hona chahiye. Ismein high-quality, original jaankari honi chahiye jise current bane rehne ke liye niyamit roop se update kiya jaata ho. Images, videos, aur infographics jaise multimedia elements ko text ka poorak hona chahiye taaki samajh behtar ho aur user ki ruchi bani rahe. Spasht, sankshep bhasha aur achhe se structured formatting, jismein chhote paragraphs, bullet points, aur subheadings shaamil hain, content ko aasani se samajhne laayak banate hain. Sabse badhkar, content ko user ko asli value pradaan karni chahiye, unki zarooraton ya sawaalon ka samadhan karte hue, aur saath hi pramanikta aur vishvasniyata banaye rakhni chahiye."
}

{
  "input": "Carbon emissions kam karne ke do tareekon ki tulna karein.",
  "output_1": "Ek strategy jise desh apne carbon emissions ko kam karne ke liye istemal kar sakte hain, woh hai carbon pricing लागू karna. Carbon pricing systems greenhouse gases ke release par ek fee ya cap-and-trade system lagate hain. Yeh prabhavi hai kyunki yeh carbon-emitting gatividhiyon ko zyada mehenga bana deta hai, is prakar unhein in prathaon se door jaane aur renewable energy jaise adhik sustainable vikalpon ki taraf badhne ke liye protsahit karta hai. Doosri strategies mein renewable energies mein nivesh karna, energy efficiency ko badhava dena, transportation sector ko electrify karna, aur behtar land management prathaon ko लागू karna shamil hai. In sabhi strategies mein emissions ko kam karne ki kshamata hai, saath hi deshon ko unke climate change commitments ko poora karne mein madad karne ki bhi.",
  "output_2": "Carbon emissions kam karne ka ek tareeka solar aur wind power jaise renewable energy sources ka upyog karna hai. Yeh sources koi carbon emissions paida nahi karte hain aur inka upyog electricity paida karne ke liye kiya ja sakta hai. Carbon emissions kam karne ka ek aur tareeka energy efficient appliances ka upyog karna aur energy conservation ka abhyas karna hai. Ismein shamil hai appliances ko istemal na hone par band karna, uplabdh hone par natural light ka upyog karna, aur istemal na hone par appliances ko unplug karna. Dono tareekon ke apne fayde aur nuksan hain, lekin dono hi carbon emissions ko kam karne mein prabhavi hain."
}

