  "output_1": "Ethos ek ethical appeal hai, jise audience ko author ki credibility ya character ke baare mein convince karne ke liye use kiya jaata hai. Pathos ek emotional appeal hai, jise audience ko unke emotions se appeal karke persuade karne ke liye use kiya jaata hai. Logos logic ka appeal hai aur isse audience ko logic aur reason ka use karke convince karne ke liye istemaal kiya jaata hai.",
  "output_2": "Pathos persuasion ka ek tool hai jise readers ke emotions ko positive ya negative feelings jagakar appeal karne ke liye use kiya jaata hai. Ise rhetoric, literature, film, aur doosre forms of expression mein use kiya jaa sakta hai. Jahan pathos ek emotional response laane ke liye use hota hai, wahin doosre rhetorical appeals credibility aur logic ko appeal karte hain, respectively. Ethos kisi person, group, ya institution ka distinguishing character, sentiment, moral nature, ya guiding beliefs hota hai. Yeh aksar facts, numbers, ya statistics ke roop mein evident hota hai aur isse audience ko ek argument ke liye convince karne ke liye use kiya jaata hai."
}

