{
  "input": "United States mein boli jaane wali languages ko compare and contrast karo, ek compare-and-contrast essay likhne ke common requirements ko follow karte hue.",
  "output_1": "US ek diverse country hai jahan Spanish se lekar French aur Chinese tak, kai alag-alag languages boli jaati hain. English sabse common language hai, jo population ke 80% se zyada log bolte hain. Spanish doosri sabse popular language hai, jise lagbhag 15% population bolti hai, aur yeh zyada tar country ke southwest region mein use hoti hai. French bhi historically Midwest aur east coast mein popular hai, aur isey lagbhag 5% population bolti hai. Doosri languages, jaise ki Chinese, Arabic, aur Russian, population ke chote percentages dwara boli jaati hain.",
  "output_2": "United States ek linguistically diverse country hai jahan 350 se zyada languages boli jaati hain. Sabse common language English hai, jise de facto national language maana jaata hai. Yeh government, business, education, aur daily life mein use hone wali primary language hai. American English ki pehchan uske alag accents, vocabulary, aur grammar se hoti hai, jo country ke alag-alag regions mein badalte rehte hain.\nSpanish United States mein boli jaane wali doosri sabse common language hai, iska main reason country ki Latin America se proximity aur badi Hispanic aur Latino population hai. Spanish California, Texas, aur Florida jaise states mein widely boli jaati hai. Yeh desh bhar ke kai schools mein bhi padhai jaati hai.\nUnited States mein boli jaane wali doosri languages mein Chinese (mainly Mandarin aur Cantonese), Tagalog, Vietnamese, French, Korean, aur German shamil hain. Yeh languages zyada tar specific immigrant communities mein boli jaati hain. For example, Tagalog Filipino community mein widely boli jaati hai, jabki Vietnamese, Vietnamese immigrants aur unke descendants ke beech common hai.\nUnited States mein Indigenous languages bhi boli jaati hain, haalanki yeh kam common hain. Inmein Navajo, Cherokee, Choctaw, aur kai doosri shamil hain. Yeh languages mainly Native American communities dwara boli jaati hain aur unke cultural heritage ka ek important part hain.\nIske contrast mein, English poore desh mein zyada universally boli aur samjhi jaati hai, jabki doosri languages shayad sirf kuch communities ya regions mein hi widely boli ya samjhi jaati hain. English zyada tar schools mein language of instruction ke taur par bhi use hoti hai, jabki doosri languages second language courses ke roop mein offer ki jaa sakti hain."
}

