{
  "input": "Cellular respiration aur photosynthesis ko compare aur contrast karo.",
  "output_1": "1. Photosynthesis plants aur kuch bacteria mein hota hai, jabki aerobic respiration sabhi living organisms mein hota hai.\n2. Photosynthesis chloroplasts mein hota hai aur light energy use karke carbon dioxide aur water ko organic molecules aur oxygen mein convert karta hai, jabki aerobic respiration mitochondria mein hota hai aur energy release karne ke liye organic molecules ko break down karta hai, jisse carbon dioxide aur water produce hota hai.\n3. Photosynthesis water ko ek reactant molecule ki tarah use karta hai aur oxygen ko by-product ki tarah produce karta hai, jabki aerobic respiration oxygen ko reactant ki tarah use karta hai aur carbon dioxide ko by-product ki tarah produce karta hai.\n4. Photosynthesis aam taur par ek exothermic reaction hai, jabki aerobic respiration ek endothermic reaction hai.\n5. Photosynthesis energy ke liye electromagnetic radiation, jaise sunlight, use karta hai, jabki aerobic respiration ATP molecules produce karta hai jo metabolic processes ke liye energy provide karte hain.",
  "output_2": "Cellular respiration aur photosynthesis living organisms mein do important processes hain. Cellular respiration organic molecules ko break down karke energy release karne ka process hai, jabki photosynthesis light energy ko chemical energy mein convert karne ka process hai. Respiration mein, food molecules se energy extract karne ke liye oxygen use hota hai, aur photosynthesis mein, glucose aur oxygen produce karne ke liye carbon dioxide aur water use hota hai."
}

