  "output_2": "Sigmoid activation function aam taur par binary classification neural network ke output layer mein use hota hai, jahan goal hota hai input ke do classes mein se ek se belong karne ki probability predict karna. Aisa isliye hai kyunki sigmoid function apne input ko 0 aur 1 ke beech ki value par map karta hai, jise ek probability ki tarah interpret kiya ja sakta hai.\n\nHyperbolic tangent (tanh) activation function sigmoid function ke jaisa hi hai, lekin yeh apne input ko -1 aur 1 ke beech ki value par map karta hai. Yeh aksar ek neural network ke hidden layers mein use hota hai, kyunki yeh model mein non-linearity introduce karne mein help karta hai. Iska use output layer mein bhi hota hai jab task ek multiclass classification problem ho.\n\nSummary mein, sigmoid binary classification ke liye use hota hai aur tanh multiclass classification ke liye ya neural network ke hidden layers mein non-linearity introduce karne ke liye use hota hai."
}

