{
  "input": "Apni productivity badhane ke 5 tarike batao.",
  "output_1": "1. Goals set karo aur unhe achieve karne ke liye ek plan banao.\n2. Notifications band karke, timers set karke, aur ek time par ek hi task par focus karke distractions ko minimize karo.\n3. Regular breaks lo aur apne brain ko rest do.\n4. Tasks ko prioritize karo aur sabse important tasks par pehle focus karo.\n5. Din ka woh best time find karo jab aap sabse zyada productive hote ho aur uss time ko apne sabse important tasks ke liye use karo.",
  "output_2": "Zaroor. **Clear Goals Set Karein:** Apne kaam ko ek purpose aur direction dene ke liye specific aur achievable goals define karein. **Tasks ko Prioritize Karein:** Unn tasks par focus karein jinka sabse zyada impact ho aur jo aapke goals ke saath align karte hon, iske liye Eisenhower Matrix jaisi techniques use karein. **Time Blocking:** Alag-alag tasks ke liye specific time blocks allocate karein taaki ek structured schedule ban sake. **Distractions Eliminate Karein:** Notifications band karke, unnecessary tabs close karke, aur ek dedicated workspace banakar interruptions ko minimize karein. **Pomodoro Technique Use Karein:** Concentration maintain karne aur burnout se bachne ke liye 25-minute ke focused intervals mein kaam karein aur uske baad ek short break lein. **Delegate aur Outsource Karein:** Jo tasks doosre log handle kar sakte hain, unhe assign karein, jisse aapka time high-priority activities ke liye free ho jayega. **Mindfulness Practice Karein:** Meditation aur deep breathing jaisi techniques focus improve karne aur stress reduce karne mein help kar sakti hain."
}

