{
  "input": "Neeche di gayi situation par apni best advice dijiye.\n\nBete ko peanut allergy hai, aur school use lagatar peanuts deta rehta hai ya lene deta hai. Yeh ek ongoing issue hai school ke second day se jab use peanut butter crackers diye gaye the. Humne isse naya school year, naye students, teachers first graders se deal karte hue thode frazzled hain, koi badi baat nahi, soch kar taal diya. Uski allergy bahut severe nahi hai par phir bhi isse deal karna fun nahi hai aur potentially life-threatening ho sakti hai. Humne saal shuru hone se pehle hi school ko uski allergy ke baare mein inform kar diya tha aur teacher se directly baat bhi ki thi kyunki agar koi aur parent snack na laaye to din ka default snack peanut butter crackers hota hai. Humne uske liye ek special alternative khareedne ka offer bhi diya, lekin unhone kaha ki yeh unnecessary hai kyunki unke paas doosre alternatives hain. Toh humne socha ki issue khatam ho gaya hai jab kuch hafte baad yeh phir se hua, is baar unhone claim kiya ki usne ek doosre student ka snack cheen liya aur unke rokne se pehle hi use khane ke liye bhaag gaya. Ab mera chhota beta thoda ziddi ho sakta hai aur main potentially aisa hote hue dekh sakti hoon isliye humne usse phir se peanuts aur woh uske liye kitne dangerous hain, is baare mein baat ki. Woh lagatar is baat se inkaar karta raha aur bola ki Mrs ne use woh diye the. Phir humne decide kiya ki principal ke saath ek meeting karni chahiye, teacher ko blame karne ya uspar jhoot bolne ka ilzaam lagane ke liye nahi, balki hopefully is situation ko control mein laane ke liye. Phir kuch hafte tak koi issue nahi hua, phir yeh dobara ho gaya. Ek baar phir story yeh hai ki \"usne use cheen liya aur bhaag gaya aur humare pakadne se pehle poora package kha liya\". Okay, toh ek 6-saal ka bachcha ek unopened crackers ka package cheenne mein, ek teacher aur ek aide ko chakma dene mein aur pakde jaane se pehle poora package khaane mein कामयाब ho gaya? Woh ro raha hai aur humse kasam kha kar keh raha hai ki use woh diye gaye the, aur itne saare incidents ke baad humein uspar believe karna hi padega. Principal aur teacher ke saath ek aur meeting se humein yeh jawab mila \"Chinta mat kijiye! Yeh dobara nahi hoga\". Humne apne bete ke saath ek aur lambi meeting ki use yeh samjhane ke liye ki agar tumhe kuch diya bhi jaaye, to poocho aur make sure karo ki usmein peanuts ya doosre nuts na hon. Phir, theek agle hi school day (meeting Friday ko hui thi) use phir se peanut butter crackers ka snack diya gaya lekin is baar usne poocha ki kya ismein nuts hain aur tab use alternative diya gaya. Humein laga ki yeh thoda sucks karta hai ki bachche ko yahan adult banna pad raha hai lekin at the end of the day, woh nuts ke baare mein poochna seekh raha hai. Humne principal ko ek email bheja jismein issue ko detail mein bataya aur kaha ki agar use dobara peanuts diye gaye to humara next stop school board hoga. Humein jawab mila \"Agar woh ab pooch raha hai to problem kya hai? Use shuru se hi poochna aana chahiye tha. Hum teachers hain, parents nahi.\" Kuch time tak humein koi issue nahi hua, is hafte tak. Kuch parents snack time ke liye PB&J sandwiches laaye the aur use ek de diya gaya. Woh nuts ke baare mein poochna bhool gaya lekin socha \"Woh sirf crackers mein the\". Humein pata chala ki parent ko class mein nut allergy ke baare mein pata tha (yeh parent snack sheet par hai) aur woh sirf ek jelly sandwich laaye the jo peanut butter waale se alag banaya gaya tha. Use yeh wala nahi diya gaya. Humne ek din hospital mein bitaya. Humne usse nuts ke baare mein endless talks ki hain aur use sikhane ki poori koshish karte hain lekin kuch blame toh yahan teachers par bhi aana chahiye na? Kya schools ki allergies se deal karne ki koi obligation nahi hoti? School lunch mein isse zero issues lagte hain aur unhone use kabhi nut nahi diya jabki menu rotation mein kai cheezein hain jinmein nuts hote hain. Use ek special tray milti hai jo kisi bhi nuts ke aas paas nahi thi. Yeh Indiana mein hai, koi bhi help appreciate ki jaayegi.",
  "output_1": "In logon par bilkul bhi trust nahi kiya ja sakta, aapko uske school mein ek scene create karna chahiye taaki logon ko unke bure behavior ke consequences dikhein.",
  "output_2": "Kya hospital visit se aapka koi cost hua? Ho sakta hai school ko apne actions mein problem na dikhe, lekin unke insurance ko dikh sakti hai. Shayad ek claim submit karne se unka attention mil jaaye?"
}

