  "output_2": "Cellular respiration aur photosynthesis jeevit jeevon mein do mahatvapurna prakriyaen hain. Cellular respiration organic molecules ko todkar energy chhodne ki prakriya hai, jabki photosynthesis light energy ko chemical energy mein badalne ki prakriya hai. Respiration mein, food molecules se energy nikalne ke liye oxygen ka istemal kiya jaata hai, aur photosynthesis mein, glucose aur oxygen banane ke liye carbon dioxide aur paani ka istemal kiya jaata hai."
