  "input": "Cellular respiration aur photosynthesis ki tulna karein aur unke beech antar batayein.",
  "output_1": "1. Photosynthesis paudhon aur kuch bacteria mein hota hai, jabki aerobic respiration sabhi jeevit jeevon mein hota hai.\n2. Photosynthesis chloroplasts mein hota hai aur prakash urja ka istemal karke carbon dioxide aur paani ko organic molecules aur oxygen mein parivartit karta hai, jabki aerobic respiration mitochondria mein hota hai aur urja mukt karne ke liye organic molecules ko todta hai, jisse carbon dioxide aur paani utpann hote hain.\n3. Photosynthesis paani ko ek reactant molecule ke roop mein upyog karta hai aur oxygen ko by-product ke roop mein utpann karta hai, jabki aerobic respiration oxygen ko ek reactant ke roop mein upyog karta hai aur carbon dioxide ko by-product ke roop mein utpann karta hai.\n4. Photosynthesis aam taur par ek exothermic reaction hai, jabki aerobic respiration ek endothermic reaction hai.\n5. Photosynthesis urja ke liye electromagnetic radiation, jaise suraj ki roshni, ka upyog karta hai, jabki aerobic respiration ATP molecules utpann karta hai jo metabolic processes ke liye urja pradan karte hain.",
  "output_2": "Cellular respiration aur photosynthesis jeevit jeevon mein do mahatvapurna prakriyaen hain. Cellular respiration organic molecules ko todkar urja mukt karne ki prakriya hai, jabki photosynthesis prakash urja ko rasayanik urja mein parivartit karne ki prakriya hai. Respiration mein, bhojan ke anuon se urja nikalne ke liye oxygen ka upyog kiya jaata hai, aur photosynthesis mein, glucose aur oxygen utpann karne ke liye carbon dioxide aur paani ka upyog kiya jaata hai."
}

