  "output_1": "Haan, radio waves ka use karke messages transmit karne ka concept 18th century mein definitely conceivable tha. 18th century sach mein great scientific exploration aur discovery ka time tha.\n\n19th century ke latter half mein, electromagnetic waves ka phenomenon, jismein radio waves bhi shamil hain, samjha jaane laga. Electromagnetism mein foundational work Michael Faraday jaise scientists ne rakha tha. James Clerk Maxwell ke 1860s mein Maxwell's equations ke formulation ki wajah se, electromagnetism ki unified theory establish hui. In equations ne electromagnetic waves ke existence ko predict kiya, jismein radio waves bhi shamil hain.\n\nIn waves ka experimental confirmation kuch decades baad aaya jab Heinrich Hertz ne, late 1880s mein, apni laboratory mein successfully electromagnetic waves produce aur detect kiye. In waves ko baad mein \"Hertzian waves\" ya simply radio waves ke naam se jaana gaya.",
  "output_2": "Nahi. Radio waves ki understanding aur unhe communication ke ek zariye ke taur par istemal karna bahut baad mein, late 19th aur early 20th centuries mein hua."
